{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\181.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Example 1:", "conf": 0.773, "box": [[191, 245], [387, 247], [387, 288], [190, 286]]}, {"text": "ii. Write pairs of the corresponding angles.", "conf": 0.914, "box": [[188, 402], [844, 379], [846, 432], [190, 455]]}, {"text": "ili Write the name of alternate interior and exterior angles.", "conf": 0.939, "box": [[188, 452], [1091, 417], [1093, 473], [190, 508]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[195, 563], [352, 563], [352, 597], [195, 597]]}, {"text": "i. Parallel lines: AB and CD, Transversal: PQ", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[188, 611], [850, 589], [852, 639], [190, 661]]}, {"text": "ii. Corresponding angles: Za and Zf; Zb and Ze;", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[189, 663], [938, 641], [940, 694], [191, 716]]}, {"text": "ili. Alternate exterior angles: Za and Zh; Zb and Zg.", "conf": 0.94, "box": [[190, 717], [989, 694], [991, 744], [191, 766]]}, {"text": "iv. Supplementary angles: Zd and Ze; Zc and Zf.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[188, 768], [945, 745], [947, 797], [190, 820]]}, {"text": "Example 2:", "conf": 0.805, "box": [[195, 824], [386, 824], [386, 863], [195, 863]]}, {"text": "Two parallel lines are intersected by a transversal, as shown in the figure.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[191, 876], [1311, 843], [1313, 889], [192, 922]]}, {"text": "Find the measurement of Za, Zb, Zc, Zd, Ze, and Zf using the properties", "conf": 0.961, "box": [[192, 928], [1334, 902], [1334, 944], [193, 969]]}, {"text": "of parallel lines.", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[195, 982], [443, 978], [443, 1018], [196, 1022]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.842, "box": [[196, 1035], [353, 1035], [353, 1069], [196, 1069]]}, {"text": "As we know that each pair of corresponding angles are equal.", "conf": 0.946, "box": [[192, 1085], [1139, 1065], [1140, 1111], [193, 1131]]}, {"text": "So, Za = 110° and Zd = 70°", "conf": 0.864, "box": [[411, 1138], [834, 1128], [835, 1164], [412, 1173]]}, {"text": "109", "conf": 0.633, "box": [[1372, 1184], [1414, 1184], [1414, 1205], [1372, 1205]]}, {"text": "Similarly, we also know that each pair of alternate interior (or exterior)", "conf": 0.942, "box": [[197, 1192], [1270, 1175], [1270, 1215], [198, 1232]]}, {"text": "angles are equal.", "conf": 0.856, "box": [[198, 1247], [464, 1242], [464, 1279], [199, 1284]]}, {"text": "So, Zb = Zd = 70°, Zd = 110°", "conf": 0.783, "box": [[411, 1295], [872, 1289], [872, 1324], [411, 1331]]}, {"text": "Similarly, mZf = 110° (vertically opposite angle)", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[198, 1346], [922, 1341], [922, 1384], [199, 1388]]}, {"text": "Ze=Zd (vertically opposite angle)", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[415, 1397], [936, 1397], [936, 1436], [415, 1436]]}, {"text": "Ze = 70°", "conf": 0.801, "box": [[415, 1452], [575, 1447], [577, 1484], [416, 1489]]}, {"text": "(: d= 70°)", "conf": 0.724, "box": [[575, 1450], [778, 1450], [778, 1490], [575, 1490]]}, {"text": "Example 3:", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[199, 1507], [388, 1504], [389, 1543], [200, 1547]]}, {"text": "Find the measurement of angles a, b and c. (Here, PQ and RS are parallel)", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[198, 1557], [1325, 1557], [1325, 1598], [198, 1598]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[199, 1612], [356, 1608], [357, 1645], [200, 1649]]}, {"text": "48°+72°+a=180°", "conf": 0.792, "box": [[281, 1662], [622, 1662], [622, 1695], [281, 1695]]}, {"text": "(Sum of angles of a triangle)", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[278, 1711], [709, 1714], [708, 1757], [278, 1754]]}, {"text": "729", "conf": 0.587, "box": [[1528, 1750], [1598, 1750], [1598, 1801], [1528, 1801]]}, {"text": "Za = 180°-48°-72°", "conf": 0.748, "box": [[416, 1764], [744, 1768], [743, 1805], [416, 1800]]}, {"text": "48°", "conf": 0.73, "box": [[1331, 1781], [1398, 1769], [1406, 1810], [1338, 1822]]}, {"text": ":09 = #7", "conf": 0.622, "box": [[418, 1819], [557, 1815], [558, 1853], [419, 1857]]}, {"text": "transversal.", "conf": 0.853, "box": [[338, 1916], [485, 1916], [485, 1946], [338, 1946]]}, {"text": "https://www.mathgames.com/skil/8.46-transversal-of-parallel-lines", "conf": 0.942, "box": [[334, 1941], [1185, 1970], [1184, 2013], [332, 1983]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.869, "box": [[298, 2101], [568, 2101], [568, 2134], [298, 2134]]}, {"text": "179", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[859, 2120], [926, 2124], [923, 2165], [856, 2160]]}]}